%% SDK fail-closed decision tree. Explained in: docs/fail-closed-behavior.md
flowchart TD
    CALL[wrapped tool call] --> CANON[canonicalize → action_hash]
    CANON --> REACH{gateway reachable?}
    REACH -->|no, mutating/high-risk| REFUSE1[refuse]
    REACH -->|yes| DEC{decision}
    DEC -->|allow| EXEC[execute]
    DEC -->|deny| REFUSE2[raise, never execute]
    DEC -->|require_approval| POLL[poll approval]
    POLL --> ST{status}
    ST -->|approved| CONSUME[consume single-use]
    ST -->|rejected/expired| REFUSE3[refuse]
    CONSUME --> MATCH{hash matches?}
    MATCH -->|yes| EXEC
    MATCH -->|no| REFUSE4[refuse - swap detected]
